      "source": [
        "## 10. Before full preprocessing: minimal baseline\n",
        "Median/mode imputation and ordinal encoding are necessary to make raw features model-ready. Arbitrary category order is a limitation of this baseline.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ee249ab1"
      },
      "id": "ee249ab1",
      "source": [
        "raw_transform = ColumnTransformer([\n",
        "    (\"num\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\", keep_empty_features=True), num_cols),\n",
        "    (\"cat\", Pipeline([\n",
        "        (\"fill\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"most_frequent\", keep_empty_features=True)),\n",
        "        (\"encode\", OrdinalEncoder(handle_unknown=\"use_encoded_value\", unknown_value=-1))\n",
        "    ]), cat_cols)\n",
        "])\n"
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": 27
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "cfaec293"
      },
      "id": "cfaec293",
      "source": [
        "## 11. After preprocessing\n",
        "Validate values, standardize category text, impute missing values, scale numeric columns, and one-hot encode categories. Unknown categories are accepted without dropping a reference category. This avoids the previous repeated warning, but unseen car models remain difficult to predict.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7e5d8184"
      },
      "id": "7e5d8184",
      "source": [
        "clean_transform = ColumnTransformer([\n",
        "    (\"num\", Pipeline([\n",
        "        (\"fill\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\", keep_empty_features=True)),\n",
        "        (\"scale\", StandardScaler())\n",
        "    ]), num_cols),\n",
        "    (\"cat\", Pipeline([\n",
        "        (\"fill\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"most_frequent\", keep_empty_features=True)),\n",
        "        (\"encode\", OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown=\"ignore\", sparse_output=False, drop=None))\n",
        "    ]), cat_cols)\n",
        "])\n"
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": 28
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
