      "source": [
        "## 12. Define the same three models\n",
        "Ridge is a regularized linear baseline. Random Forest averages trees. Gradient Boosting adds trees sequentially to correct errors. These are sensible candidates, not proven best algorithms for every dataset.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "a93083ef"
      },
      "id": "a93083ef",
      "source": [
        "algorithms = {\n",
        "    \"Ridge Regression\": Ridge(alpha=1.0),\n",
        "    \"Random Forest\": RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=200, random_state=42, n_jobs=-1),\n",
        "    \"Gradient Boosting\": GradientBoostingRegressor(\n",
        "        n_estimators=200, learning_rate=0.05, max_depth=3, random_state=42)\n",
        "}\n"
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": 30
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "b462c72b"
      },
      "id": "b462c72b",
      "source": [
        "## 13. Build the three stages, including PCA\n",
        "PCA retains at least 95% of variance in transformed features. It does not guarantee 95% predictive information or better scores. Scaling is useful for Ridge/PCA; trees generally do not need scaling.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9659513e"
      },
      "id": "9659513e",
      "source": [
        "def make_pipeline(algorithm, method):\n",
        "    if method == \"Raw\":\n",
        "        return Pipeline([(\"encode\", clone(raw_transform)), (\"model\", clone(algorithm))])\n",
        "    steps = [(\"clean\", FunctionTransformer(clean_features)),\n",
        "             (\"encode\", clone(clean_transform))]\n",
        "    if method == \"Preprocessed + PCA\":\n",
        "        steps.append((\"pca\", PCA(n_components=0.95, svd_solver=\"full\")))\n",
        "    return Pipeline(steps + [(\"model\", clone(algorithm))])\n"
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": 31
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
