        "## 20e. Feature importance\n",
        "Permutation importance measures how much shuffling an original predictor increases the selected model’s test MAE. It is diagnostic, not causal evidence; correlated predictors can share importance. Do not use it to retune against this same test set.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
